{"id":35185,"date":"2025-09-23T12:54:28","date_gmt":"2025-09-23T12:54:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/bakirkoymurategitim.com.tr\/?page_id=35185"},"modified":"2026-02-27T12:28:17","modified_gmt":"2026-02-27T12:28:17","slug":"mentorluk","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/mentorluk\/","title":{"rendered":"Benzersiz Ment\u00f6rl\u00fck Sistemi"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-page\" data-elementor-id=\"35185\" class=\"elementor elementor-35185\" data-elementor-post-type=\"page\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-49e5448 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"49e5448\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-096dabe e-con-full e-flex e-con e-child\" data-id=\"096dabe\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-251a86e e-con-full animated-slow e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"251a86e\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;ekit--slide-up&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-5873e76 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"5873e76\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h1>Benzersiz Ment\u00f6rl\u00fck Sistemimiz\u00a0<\/h1><h2><br \/>Ment\u00f6rl\u00fck Nedir?<\/h2><p><br \/>Ment\u00f6rl\u00fck, \u00f6\u011frencinin s\u0131nava haz\u0131rlanmas\u0131n\u0131n yan\u0131nda ders ve okul ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131n\u0131n artmas\u0131n\u0131 ama\u00e7layan, \u00f6ncelikle \u00f6\u011frencinin \u00f6\u011frenme stilini belirleyip g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc ve zay\u0131f y\u00f6nlerini g\u00f6stererek \u00f6\u011frencinin d\u00fczenli, planl\u0131 programl\u0131 \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flayan ve bunu disiplinli, sistemli takip eden bir rehberlik hizmetidir.<\/p><p>Temel amac\u0131m\u0131z \u00f6\u011frencinin okul hayat\u0131n\u0131 kolayla\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p, s\u0131nav s\u00fcrecine uyumunu sa\u011flamakt\u0131r.<\/p><p>Ment\u00f6r; yol g\u00f6steren, bilgisi ile y\u00f6nlendiren ve \u00f6\u011frenciye \u00fcniversiteye giri\u015f s\u00fcrecinde ya\u015fam disiplini kazand\u0131racak beceriler sa\u011flayan ki\u015fidir.<\/p><h2>Alan\u0131nda Uzman Rehber \u00d6\u011fretmenlerimiz ile Y\u00fcr\u00fctt\u00fc\u011f\u00fcm\u00fcz Ment\u00f6rl\u00fck Hizmetimizin \u0130\u015fleyi\u015fi<\/h2><h3><br \/>Veli ile \u0130leti\u015fim<\/h3><p><br \/>Ment\u00f6r\u00fcm\u00fcz her hafta d\u00fczenli olarak \u00f6\u011frencinin ders ve program durumu hakk\u0131nda velimize bilgi verip, bu bilgileri raporlamaktad\u0131r.<\/p><p>Ayr\u0131ca \u00f6\u011frencinin bilinmesi gereken di\u011fer y\u00f6nleri ve e\u011fitimi ilgili durumlar\u0131 g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmek i\u00e7in velimiz ile \u00fc\u00e7 haftada bir kez y\u00fcz y\u00fcze g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmeler sa\u011flan\u0131r.<\/p><p><strong>Ment\u00f6r &#8211; \u00d6\u011frenci &#8211; Veli<\/strong> \u00fc\u00e7geninde \u00f6\u011frencinin \u015fu anki durumundan daha iyi hale gelebilmesi i\u00e7in toplant\u0131lar yap\u0131l\u0131r. Ment\u00f6rl\u00fck hizmetinin kalitesi ve s\u00fcreklili\u011fi bu \u00fc\u00e7 unsurun ili\u015fkisine ba\u011fl\u0131d\u0131r.<\/p><p>Bu \u00fc\u00e7 unsurun birbiri ile ileti\u015fimi \u00e7ok \u00f6nemlidir. Ne kadar \u00e7ok ileti\u015fim kurulursa \u00f6\u011frencinin motivasyon ve ba\u015far\u0131s\u0131 bir o kadar artacakt\u0131r.<\/p><h3>Plan Program Haz\u0131rlama<\/h3><p><br \/>D\u00fczenli olarak her haftan\u0131n belli saatine randevu verilerek, ki\u015fiye \u00f6zel bir saatte ders program\u0131 haz\u0131rlan\u0131r.<\/p><p>Bizim i\u00e7in her \u00f6\u011frenci \u00f6zeldir. Her \u00f6\u011frenciye farkl\u0131 ders \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma program\u0131 haz\u0131rlan\u0131r. \u00c7\u00fcnk\u00fc her \u00f6\u011frencinin yetersiz oldu\u011fu ders ve konu farkl\u0131d\u0131r. Ki\u015fiye \u00f6zel ders program\u0131n\u0131n d\u00fczenli y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fclmesi \u00e7ok \u00f6nemlidir. Bu y\u00fczden her \u00f6\u011frencinin y\u0131lsonuna kadar g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fme g\u00fcn\u00fc ve saati bellidir.<\/p><p>Ders \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma program\u0131 haz\u0131rlan\u0131rken rehber \u00f6\u011fretmenimiz do\u011fru ve verimli bir program\u0131 haz\u0131rlayabilmek i\u00e7in kurumumuzun kullanm\u0131\u015f oldu\u011fu yapay zek\u00e2 destekli \u00f6l\u00e7me ve de\u011ferlendirme program\u0131n\u0131 kullan\u0131r.<\/p><p>Bu program sayesinde her \u00f6\u011frencimizin girmi\u015f oldu\u011fu deneme s\u0131navlar\u0131ndaki hatalar\u0131na bak\u0131larak hangi \u00fcnitelerde ne kadar ba\u015far\u0131 g\u00f6stermi\u015f, ne kadar soruyu bo\u015f b\u0131rakm\u0131\u015f bu veriler detayl\u0131 bir \u015fekilde analiz edilir.<\/p><p>Daha sonra \u00f6\u011frencinin seviyesi ve ba\u015far\u0131 durumuna g\u00f6re uygun kitaplar \u00fczerinden \u00f6devler verilip kontrol edilir. Akademik \u00f6zg\u00fcven olu\u015fmas\u0131 bak\u0131m\u0131ndan yapabilece\u011fi sorulardan ve kitaplardan ba\u015flan\u0131r.<\/p><h3>S\u0131nav Sonu\u00e7lar\u0131n\u0131n De\u011ferlendirilmesi<\/h3><p><br \/>Her s\u0131nav sonucu mutlaka ment\u00f6r taraf\u0131ndan analiz edilerek yorumlan\u0131r. Ve yorumlanm\u0131\u015f s\u0131nav sonucu raporlanarak veliye de iletilir.<\/p><p>S\u0131nav sonucunun de\u011ferlendirilmesi \u00fc\u00e7 haftada bir olan y\u00fcz y\u00fcze g\u00f6r\u00fc\u015fmelerde velimiz ile birlikte de de\u011ferlendirilir.<\/p><p>S\u0131nav\u0131n ba\u015f\u0131nda ya da sonunda artan yanl\u0131\u015flar ile ilgili, alan\u0131nda uzmanl\u0131k gerektiren, yorumlama becerisi olan rehber \u00f6\u011fretmenlerimiz taraf\u0131ndan s\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131 ya\u015fay\u0131p ya\u015famad\u0131\u011f\u0131, aceleci olup olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 belirlenir. S\u00fcreyi iyi kullanmas\u0131 i\u00e7in tavsiye ve stratejilerde bulunur.<\/p><h3>\u00d6\u011frenciyi Yak\u0131ndan Tan\u0131ma<\/h3><p><br \/>Ment\u00f6r, \u00f6\u011frencinin kendini tan\u0131mas\u0131 ve anlamas\u0131, ger\u00e7ek\u00e7i hedefler olu\u015fturmas\u0131, g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc ve zay\u0131f y\u00f6nlerinin ortaya \u00e7\u0131kar\u0131lmas\u0131 i\u00e7in bireyi tan\u0131ma teknikleri uygular.<\/p><ul><li><strong>D2 D\u0130KKAT TEST\u0130<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>MESLEK\u0130 E\u011e\u0130L\u0130M ENVANTER\u0130<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>\u00d6\u011eRENME ST\u0130LLER\u0130 \u00d6L\u00c7E\u011e\u0130<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>KEND\u0130N\u0130 DE\u011eERLEND\u0130RME ENVANTER\u0130<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p><br \/>Bu testler uygulanarak sa\u011fl\u0131kl\u0131 ve ak\u0131lc\u0131 tercihler yap\u0131lmas\u0131na yard\u0131mc\u0131 olunur. Bu testlerin uygulanmas\u0131 i\u00e7in ment\u00f6rlerimiz gerekli donan\u0131ma sahiptir. Hizmet i\u00e7i e\u011fitimlerle ment\u00f6rl\u00fck birimimiz kendini s\u00fcrekli yenilemekte ve geli\u015ftirmektedir.<\/p><p>Bu t\u0131pk\u0131 \u015funa benzer, nas\u0131l ki bir doktor hastas\u0131na do\u011fru bir tedaviyi uygulamak istiyorsa, do\u011fru tan\u0131 koymas\u0131 \u00e7ok \u00f6nemlidir. Do\u011fru tan\u0131y\u0131 koyabilmesi i\u00e7inde baz\u0131 tahlil ve raporlar al\u0131p sonu\u00e7lar\u0131na bakmas\u0131 ve de\u011ferlendirmesi gerekir.<\/p><h2>Etkili Kurs Sistemimiz<\/h2><h3><br \/>Etkin E\u011fitim<br \/><br \/><\/h3><ul><li><strong>K\u00fc\u00e7\u00fck Gruplarla E\u011fitim<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Aktif \u00d6\u011frenme ve Uygulamal\u0131 Dersler<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>Her \u00d6\u011frencinin Dan\u0131\u015fabilece\u011fi Ment\u00f6rl\u00fck Sistemi<\/strong><\/li><li><strong>G\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fc E\u011fitim Altyap\u0131s\u0131<\/strong><\/li><\/ul><p><br \/>Alan\u0131nda uzman, yeterli tecr\u00fcbeye sahip yazar \u00f6\u011fretmen kadromuz, ment\u00f6rl\u00fck sistemi ve (Tekrar Dersleri) ekstra kurs sistemi ile bir yandan okula devam edip bir yandan s\u0131nava haz\u0131rl\u0131k s\u00fcrecinde \u00f6\u011frencilerimizin ihtiya\u00e7 duydu\u011fu deste\u011fi t\u00fcm y\u00f6nleriyle ve do\u011fru bir \u015fekilde sa\u011flayarak, istedi\u011fi ve hedefledi\u011fi \u00fcniversite hayaline ula\u015ft\u0131r\u0131yoruz.<\/p><h3>Kurumsal Disiplin ve Ba\u015far\u0131<\/h3><p><br \/>Disiplin, e\u011fitim ve \u00f6\u011fretimin do\u011fru programlanmas\u0131 ve ba\u015far\u0131 takip sisteminin d\u00fczenli olarak y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fclmesi ile sa\u011flan\u0131r. \u00d6\u011frencinin ama\u00e7lar\u0131na, yeteneklerine, isteklerine ve ge\u00e7mi\u015f bilgilerine uygun olarak haz\u0131rlanan bir e\u011fitim program\u0131, \u00f6\u011frencinin ilgisini \u00e7ekerek i\u015f birli\u011fi i\u00e7erisinde olmas\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flar.<\/p><h2>E\u011fitim Sistemi<\/h2><h3><br \/>Ekstra Kurs Sistemi (Tekrar Dersleri)<\/h3><p><br \/>Her y\u0131l kurslar ba\u015flad\u0131ktan bir s\u00fcre sonra t\u00fcm derslerden, haftan\u0131n \u00e7e\u015fitli g\u00fcn ve saatlerine Ekstra Kurs Gruplar\u0131 a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r. Bu gruplarda, \u00f6\u011frencilerin en \u00e7ok g\u00fc\u00e7l\u00fck ya\u015fad\u0131\u011f\u0131 dersler \u00f6rne\u011fin (Matematik, Fizik, Geometri, Edebiyat gibi) ve di\u011fer bran\u015flardan da s\u00fcrekli tekrarlar yap\u0131l\u0131r. Belirtilen bu gruplar\u0131n haftal\u0131k konu s\u0131ras\u0131 ayr\u0131ca ilan edilir. \u00d6\u011frencilerimiz bu gruplarda, konu s\u0131ras\u0131n\u0131 inceleyerek eksik oldu\u011fu konular\u0131 takip eder, bu gruplar\u0131n program\u0131 10 hafta s\u00fcrer. 10 hafta sonra bu gruplar ba\u015ftan ba\u015flar ve ikinci 10 haftal\u0131k periyotta \u00f6\u011frencilerimiz istedi\u011fi dersleri tekrar tekrar takip etme f\u0131rsat\u0131 yakalar. Bu sayede her seviyedeki \u00f6\u011frencimizde tam \u00f6\u011frenme sa\u011flan\u0131r.<\/p><h3>Bire Bir Soru \u00c7\u00f6z\u00fcmleri<\/h3><h3>S.E.S (Soru Eritme Saati)<\/h3><p><br \/>Her y\u0131l kurslar\u0131n ba\u015flad\u0131\u011f\u0131 hafta itibariyle her dersten, haftan\u0131n \u00e7e\u015fitli g\u00fcn ve saatlerine birebir soru \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcm saatleri a\u00e7\u0131l\u0131r. Bu saatleri belirten S.E.S program\u0131 her hafta d\u00fczenli olarak \u00f6ncesinde ilan edilir. \u00d6\u011frencilerimiz bu programa g\u00f6re Soru Eritme Saatlerine kat\u0131larak, kendi sorular\u0131n\u0131 ana ders \u00f6\u011fretmenine sorabilir ve bu sayede soru \u00e7\u00f6zme h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131 artt\u0131rabilir.<\/p><h3>Deneme S\u0131navlar\u0131<\/h3><h3><br \/>D\u00fczey Belirleme S\u0131nav\u0131<\/h3><p><br \/>Bu s\u0131nav ile benzer d\u00fczeydeki \u00f6\u011frencilerin bir arada olmas\u0131 ve grup \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131ndan \u00fcst d\u00fczey verim al\u0131nmas\u0131n\u0131 ama\u00e7lad\u0131k.<\/p><h3>Tarama S\u0131navlar\u0131<\/h3><p>\u00a0<\/p><h2>BTS (Ba\u015far\u0131 Takip S\u0131nav\u0131)<\/h2><p>Tarama s\u0131nav\u0131n\u0131n oldu\u011fu g\u00fcne kadar i\u015flenen konulardan haz\u0131rlanm\u0131\u015f olan s\u0131navlar ile elde edilen sonu\u00e7lar incelenerek; anla\u015f\u0131lmayan, beklenen netice al\u0131namayan derslere karar verilir, o dersler ile ilgili ment\u00f6rlerin takibiyle birlikte ek dersler, et\u00fctler, soru \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcmleri, ek s\u0131navlar d\u00fczenlenerek tam \u00f6\u011frenme sa\u011flanana kadar ek programlar konulur.<\/p><h3>Genel S\u0131navlar<\/h3><p><br \/>T\u00fcm konular\u0131 kapsayan genel denemeler ile y\u0131l i\u00e7inde T\u00fcrkiye genelinde en \u00e7ok tercih edilen farkl\u0131 yay\u0131n evlerinin deneme s\u0131navlar\u0131 her hafta bir TYT bir AYT olmak \u00fczere iki tane s\u0131nav yap\u0131lmaktad\u0131r. Bu s\u0131navlar sayesinde ba\u015far\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6l\u00e7\u00fcp, ger\u00e7e\u011fe en yak\u0131n sonu\u00e7lar ile seviyenizi belirleyip \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131n\u0131za birlikte y\u00f6n veriyoruz.<\/p><h3>Ger\u00e7ek S\u0131nav Provalar\u0131<\/h3><p><br \/>Ger\u00e7ek s\u0131navla \u00f6rt\u00fc\u015fen s\u0131nav kurallar\u0131n\u0131 birebir uygulayarak s\u0131nav motivasyonu sa\u011flanmaktad\u0131r. Kendinizi s\u0131navda hissedece\u011finiz, d\u00fczenli olarak tekrarlad\u0131\u011f\u0131m\u0131z bir aktivite olan &#8216;Ger\u00e7ek S\u0131nav Provalar\u0131&#8217; ile s\u0131nav zaman\u0131 geldi\u011finde kendinizi daha rahat hissedeceksiniz \u00e7\u00fcnk\u00fc birebir s\u0131nav ortam\u0131nda, \u00fcniversite anfilerinde veya anla\u015fmal\u0131 okullarda en az 2 kez &#8216;Ger\u00e7ek S\u0131nav Provalar\u0131na&#8217; girmi\u015f olacaks\u0131n\u0131z.<\/p><h3>Ek Denemeler<\/h3><p><br \/>Takvimimize sizler i\u00e7in ek deneme s\u0131navlar\u0131 yerle\u015ftiriyoruz, h\u0131z\u0131n\u0131z\u0131 artt\u0131r\u0131n; stresten uzakla\u015f\u0131n ve eksiklerinizi tamamlay\u0131n diye!<\/p><h3>Seri Denemeler<\/h3><p><br \/>S\u0131nava yakla\u015f\u0131lan s\u00fcre\u00e7te her g\u00fcne bir veya iki adet deneme s\u0131nav\u0131 konulmaktad\u0131r. Bu s\u0131navlar T\u00fcrkiye Geneli uygulanan, ger\u00e7ek s\u0131nava en yak\u0131n d\u00fczeyde olan yay\u0131n evlerinin haz\u0131rlam\u0131\u015f oldu\u011fu s\u0131navlardan olu\u015fmaktad\u0131r. Seri denemeler sayesinde \u00f6\u011frenci farkl\u0131 tip sorular g\u00f6rebilir. S\u0131nav kayg\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 azalt\u0131r, test tekni\u011fine daha fazla uyum sa\u011flamaya ve s\u00fcreyi daha iyi kullanmaya ba\u015flar.<\/p><h3>S\u0131f\u0131r Hata Kitab\u0131<\/h3><p><br \/>Yapay zek\u00e2 destekli \u00f6l\u00e7me ve de\u011ferlendirme program\u0131 sayesinde, Her \u00f6\u011frenciye \u00f6zel olarak, y\u0131l i\u00e7inde uygulanan t\u00fcm deneme s\u0131navlar\u0131nda yanl\u0131\u015f yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 ve bo\u015f b\u0131rakt\u0131\u011f\u0131 sorulardan olu\u015fan &#8220;S\u0131f\u0131r Hata kitab\u0131&#8221; verilir. Bu kitapta yer alan sorular\u0131 yan\u0131tlayarak \u00f6\u011frencinin tam \u00f6\u011frenmesi ve s\u0131navlarda \u00fcst\u00fcn ba\u015far\u0131 sa\u011flamas\u0131 hedeflenir.<!-- notionvc: 5f46c05a-ffd0-4aec-a3e0-16b90e051877 --><\/p><p><!-- notionvc: 3b54f897-684c-4c83-be7d-54cd1573317c --><\/p><p><!-- notionvc: f06fd33f-ee2e-4dc1-8e7b-9b5e9dc8cbb2 --><\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ec98658 e-con-full animated-slow e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ec98658\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;ekit--slide-up&quot;}\">\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-89af726 e-con-full animated-slow e-flex elementor-invisible e-con e-child\" data-id=\"89af726\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" data-settings=\"{&quot;animation&quot;:&quot;ekit--slide-left&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4dfe10 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c4dfe10\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/gop_murat-egitim_01.webp\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-35578\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/gop_murat-egitim_01.webp 600w, https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/gop_murat-egitim_01-300x300.webp 300w, https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/gop_murat-egitim_01-150x150.webp 150w, https:\/\/gaziosmanpasamurategitim.com.tr\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/gop_murat-egitim_01-100x100.webp 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 